                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/math/0405303"} math.AG/0405303
                %a{:href => "http://www.ams.org/mathscinet-getitem?mr=2199280"} MR2006k:53067
                %a{:href => "http://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.geomphys.2005.03.004"} doi
          %h4#geometry_of_supergravity Geometry of supergravity
          %p
            Generalized complex geometry and variants of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/exceptional+generalized+complex+geometry"} exceptional generalized complex geometry
